 "remarks": "Desirable West Norwalk! Nestled in a quiet, park-like setting, this bright and inviting second-floor condo offers abundant natural light throughout. The well-appointed kitchen overlooks the open-concept living and dining area, creating an ideal space for both everyday living and entertaining. The spacious primary bedroom features a private balcony, perfect for enjoying your morning coffee or unwinding at the end of the day. A generously sized second bedroom provides flexibility as a guest room, home office, or additional living space. The updated full bathroom features modern finishes. Additional conveniences include an in-unit washer and dryer and abundant storage with an attached garage, additional storage room, and attic access. Conveniently located near Route 7, shopping, dining, and commuting routes, this home combines comfort, functionality, and a desirable location. See it today!",
